# The rows of src/runtime/recipes/vulpen/library/parts/image-file/ImageFile.cpp, a call each (src/tools/bench/bench.py).

## ImageFile.cpp/ImageFile::bind
[("file", "/p/a.png"), ("switch", "pane")] -> ["texture picture of u8vec4", "file /p/a.png", "output tabs"]; tabs [a.png (preview)]
[("switch", "pane")] -> ["texture picture of u8vec4", "output tabs"]; tabs []

## ImageFile.cpp/ImageFile::cook
a file not there -> sent [": param set pane shown second", ": image clear n.picture"]; uploads []; logged ["error: <here>/gone.png is empty, or not there"]
a.png opened -> sent [": param set pane shown second"]; uploads ["image 0 2x1, 1 levels, 8 bytes #8869e677"]; logged []
a.png opened -> sent [": param set pane shown second"]; uploads ["image 0 2x1, 1 levels, 8 bytes #8869e677"]; logged []
and the frame after -> sent []; uploads []; logged []
bound again with no file -> sent [": image clear n.picture", ": param set pane shown first"]; uploads []; logged []
its version as before -> sent []; uploads []; logged []
its version moved -> sent []; uploads ["image 0 2x1, 1 levels, 8 bytes #8869e677"]; logged []
then a file not there opened in its place -> sent [": param set pane shown second", ": image clear n.picture"]; uploads []; logged ["error: <here>/gone.png is empty, or not there"]
